# Google Analytics 4 measurement ID (e.g. G-XXXXXXXXXX).
# Leave unset to disable analytics entirely — every tracking call becomes a
# no-op without it, so the site works fine with nothing configured.
# To enable: create a GA4 property, copy its Measurement ID, and set this
# as an environment variable in the Vercel project settings (or a local
# .env file for `npm run dev`).
VITE_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=
